---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Changelog · MindContext — Constellation" description="Notable changes in the MindContext public beta.">
  <div class="content-shell">
    <PageHero eyebrow="CHANGELOG" title="What changed." description="A concise record of visible product milestones during the public beta." />

    <section class="timeline">
      <article>
        <time datetime="2026-09-29">September 29, 2026</time>
        <div><h2>Constellation identity & public site</h2><p>Adopted the Linked Star identity, shared design tokens, blue/amber graph language, brand documentation and the first public product site. Clarified the Core Free Promise so basic note access and editing remain free.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article>
        <time datetime="2026-09-28">September 28, 2026</time>
        <div><h2>Markdown authoring & task rendering</h2><p>Added shared authoring commands, toolbar and slash commands, and corrected task-list rendering across desktop and mobile.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article>
        <time datetime="2026-09-25">September 25, 2026</time>
        <div><h2>Open Markdown compatibility</h2><p>Expanded the Preserve / Parse / Render / Interact compatibility work for portable Markdown and Obsidian-style conventions.</p></div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
